config BR2_PACKAGE_SYSDIAG
	bool "sysdiag"
	help
	  Install the sysdiag diagnostic command and enable reusable kernel
	  and BusyBox diagnostics. The report includes system information,
	  interrupts, clocks, device nodes, and kernel messages. When the LTDC
	  driver is present, it also reports display clocks and registers.

	  This package is independent of every example. Select it temporarily
	  beside whichever example is being debugged, then disable it to produce
	  the smaller normal image.
